  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Congratulating someone on an achievement",
     "texto": [
      "**Selamat atas + noun** is used to congratulate someone on an event: **Selamat atas kelulusan** (congratulations on the graduation!).",
      "**Memberi selamat kepada seseorang** means to congratulate a person. \"Selamat\" also appears in greetings; the context makes its function clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about results",
     "texto": [
      "**Lulus** means to pass or to graduate, depending on the context. **Berhasil** indicates that something has been achieved; **keberhasilan** is the success obtained. The forms do not express on their own when the action happened."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
